	"Description": "# Ship from Inventory\n\nby Platonymous\n\n---\nShip from the Inventory Menu, works just like the trashcan.\n![](https://imgur.com/T5Eybda.png)\nAdds a shipping bin to the Inventory Menu that you can throw items in to ship them.\n![](https://imgur.com/b8d5H2A.png)\nIf you have any questions you can usually find me on the [Stardew Valley Discord](https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Community#Discord)  under the username **Routine**#8715\n![](https://imgur.com/u7Unylz.png)\nIf you like my mods and want to support me, you can do so via [Paypal](https://www.paypal.me/platonymousgames)   or on [Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=406905) .",
